on $r=-3\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta $ gives a circle of radius $|-1.5|=1.5$ centered at the point $(-1.5,0),$ as shown below.\n\n![](images/74/748c15bf1cb55a3ed5ce4d08c4458e12f6ad97df1f1658831968d41c8c8f4bbb.png)"}]}
